        {
          "id": "03c41569-c717-47fd-97ab-1a5b81b64263",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>¿Qué música escuchas?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Que música você escuta?</strong></p><p>Essa pergunta abre o tema de forma simples e natural.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/3035e91156ae4cb0b37c36c18641c38e_l01b01-que-musica-escuchas.mp3?Expires=1794099588&Signature=oiLLC1sPhPl9j6vxv131xYe33ESTGSnGjNJVVCwafBqHe9vaTGRvNAdrSRm72rjSi~xx97fw4QhcKaGnr7Fkq2khb2dk0G2t9wBhGqjibJjfhMQ8dtoOZpXJPYq1JDJ3JcEXbO8d4UjxV2GW8KTxBHQhnpBHNtk~x2qSdkJsIYUJmD0VJOMMKqbZhMAO5JrnN8LfYGFp0biusHNoW9isdzp7EddT1~eJ4tZclzOZOAq8BWuREujWg-v0gmTUw98JMO9ZyPQnDdS8uDW40ZXJsrqaSsiZKjVmS9lL5golXvG6DOGaCag71issKJoST6lHPNm8SzJq1n4-Fl5OQX8ERQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
